WEBVTT

00:51:56.413 --> 00:52:00.288
a sort of crossroads now is different
opportunities have come your way weighing

00:52:00.288 --> 00:52:03.246
the reasons to do it, weighing
the reasons not to do it.

00:52:03.454 --> 00:52:06.288
And you've stated it's not about the
number of things on the list.

00:52:06.288 --> 00:52:08.621
It's about the weight of those things.

00:52:08.621 --> 00:52:12.246
And almost always you think that
the things that mean and matter

00:52:12.246 --> 00:52:15.329
the most really come down to one question.

00:52:15.329 --> 00:52:19.246
And that question is, what
do you really want to do?

00:52:19.913 --> 00:52:25.871
And I wanted to see if you can help me
understand how to know when something

00:52:25.871 --> 00:52:28.579
is the thing you really want to do.

00:52:29.829 --> 00:52:33.038
Archives again, with the
heart of the system.